{"segment_id": "seg_p0030_body_l0024", "page_id": "p0030", "segment_type": "body", "latin_text": "etiam, penitusq́; excutiant : ita eos non tenui lectio-", "markers": [], "translation_history": [{"version": 1, "stage": "machine_draft", "timestamp": "2026-05-17T03:09:22Z", "english": "and thoroughly to sift them: thus he would not have them content with a slight reading,", "notes": "Litotes 'non tenui lectione' rendered as positive 'slight reading' per rule 7b.", "uncertain": false, "model": "claude-opus-4-7", "lexicon_profile": "auto", "source_unit_id": "p0030_body_l0024"}], "final_english": "", "translation_status": "machine_draft", "seq": 24}
{"segment_id": "seg_p0030_body_l0025", "page_id": "p0030", "segment_type": "body", "latin_text": "ne contentos eſſe vult, ſed aſſiduam, acrem, labo-", "markers": [], "translation_history": [{"version": 1, "stage": "machine_draft", "timestamp": "2026-05-17T03:09:22Z", "english": "but requires an assiduous, keen, and laborious", "notes": "", "uncertain": false, "model": "claude-opus-4-7", "lexicon_profile": "auto", "source_unit_id": "p0030_body_l0025"}], "final_english": "", "translation_status": "machine_draft", "seq": 25}
{"segment_id": "seg_p0030_body_l0026", "page_id": "p0030", "segment_type": "body", "latin_text": "rioſam inueſtigandi perſcrutandiq́; diligentiam re-", "markers": [], "translation_history": [{"version": 1, "stage": "machine_draft", "timestamp": "2026-05-17T03:09:22Z", "english": "diligence in investigating and searching them through,", "notes": "", "uncertain": false, "model": "claude-opus-4-7", "lexicon_profile": "auto", "source_unit_id": "p0030_body_l0026"}], "final_english": "", "translation_status": "machine_draft", "seq": 26}
{"segment_id": "seg_p0030_body_l0027", "page_id": "p0030", "segment_type": "body", "latin_text": "quirit, qualem illi adhibere ſolent, qui defoſſum in", "markers": [], "translation_history": [{"version": 1, "stage": "machine_draft", "timestamp": "2026-05-17T03:09:22Z", "english": "such as those are wont to employ who most diligently seek", "notes": "", "uncertain": false, "model": "claude-opus-4-7", "lexicon_profile": "auto", "source_unit_id": "p0030_body_l0027"}], "final_english": "", "translation_status": "machine_draft", "seq": 27}
{"segment_id": "seg_p0030_body_l0028", "page_id": "p0030", "segment_type": "body", "latin_text": "terra theſaurum diligentiſſimè quærunt,", "markers": [], "translation_history": [{"version": 1, "stage": "machine_draft", "timestamp": "2026-05-17T03:09:22Z", "english": "a treasure buried in the earth,", "notes": "", "uncertain": false, "model": "claude-opus-4-7", "lexicon_profile": "auto", "source_unit_id": "p0030_body_l0028"}], "final_english": "", "translation_status": "machine_draft", "seq": 28}
{"segment_id": "seg_p0031_body_l0001", "page_id": "p0031", "segment_type": "body", "latin_text": "Et quando Chriſtus ſine exceptione iuſſit ſcruta-", "markers": [], "translation_history": [{"version": 1, "stage": "machine_draft", "timestamp": "2026-05-17T03:09:22Z", "english": "And when Christ without exception commanded that the sacred scriptures be searched,", "notes": "", "uncertain": false, "model": "claude-opus-4-7", "lexicon_profile": "auto", "source_unit_id": "p0031_body_l0001"}], "final_english": "", "translation_status": "machine_draft", "seq": 1}
{"segment_id": "seg_p0031_body_l0002", "page_id": "p0031", "segment_type": "body", "latin_text": "ri ſacras Scripturas, nó has modò, aut illas, aut quaſ-", "markers": [], "translation_history": [{"version": 1, "stage": "machine_draft", "timestamp": "2026-05-17T03:09:22Z", "english": "not these only, or those, or certain ones;", "notes": "", "uncertain": false, "model": "claude-opus-4-7", "lexicon_profile": "auto", "source_unit_id": "p0031_body_l0002"}], "final_english": "", "translation_status": "machine_draft", "seq": 2}
{"segment_id": "seg_p0031_body_l0003", "page_id": "p0031", "segment_type": "body", "latin_text": "dam; manifeſtum eſt, his verbis præſcribi, vt vniuer-", "markers": [], "translation_history": [{"version": 1, "stage": "machine_draft", "timestamp": "2026-05-17T03:09:22Z", "english": "it is manifest that by these words it is prescribed that we should search", "notes": "", "uncertain": false, "model": "claude-opus-4-7", "lexicon_profile": "auto", "source_unit_id": "p0031_body_l0003"}], "final_english": "", "translation_status": "machine_draft", "seq": 3}
{"segment_id": "seg_p0031_body_l0004", "page_id": "p0031", "segment_type": "body", "latin_text": "ſas ſcrutemur, non in certis Scripturarum partibus", "markers": [], "translation_history": [{"version": 1, "stage": "machine_draft", "timestamp": "2026-05-17T03:09:22Z", "english": "them all, and not, clinging to certain parts of the scriptures,", "notes": "", "uncertain": false, "model": "claude-opus-4-7", "lexicon_profile": "auto", "source_unit_id": "p0031_body_l0004"}], "final_english": "", "translation_status": "machine_draft", "seq": 4}
{"segment_id": "seg_p0031_body_l0005", "page_id": "p0031", "segment_type": "body", "latin_text": "hærentes contemnamus aut prætermittamus reli-", "markers": [], "translation_history": [{"version": 1, "stage": "machine_draft", "timestamp": "2026-05-17T03:09:22Z", "english": "despise or pass over the rest.", "notes": "", "uncertain": false, "model": "claude-opus-4-7", "lexicon_profile": "auto", "source_unit_id": "p0031_body_l0005"}], "final_english": "", "translation_status": "machine_draft", "seq": 5}
{"segment_id": "seg_p0031_body_l0006", "page_id": "p0031", "segment_type": "body", "latin_text": "quas. Omnes enim Chriſto non obſcurum teſtimo-", "markers": [], "translation_history": [{"version": 1, "stage": "machine_draft", "timestamp": "2026-05-17T03:09:22Z", "english": "For all of them give plain testimony to Christ.", "notes": "Litotes normalization applied per rule 7b: 'non obscurum testimonium' → 'plain testimony'.", "uncertain": false, "model": "claude-opus-4-7", "lexicon_profile": "auto", "source_unit_id": "p0031_body_l0006"}], "final_english": "", "translation_status": "machine_draft", "seq": 6}
{"segment_id": "seg_p0031_body_l0007", "page_id": "p0031", "segment_type": "body", "latin_text": "nium dicunt. Scripturas autem & Papiſtæ celebrãt,", "markers": [], "translation_history": [{"version": 1, "stage": "machine_draft", "timestamp": "2026-05-17T03:09:22Z", "english": "Now the scriptures are praised even by the papists,", "notes": "Passive voice chosen per rule 7c since the discourse topic is the scriptures.", "uncertain": false, "model": "claude-opus-4-7", "lexicon_profile": "auto", "source_unit_id": "p0031_body_l0007"}], "final_english": "", "translation_status": "machine_draft", "seq": 7}
{"segment_id": "seg_p0031_body_l0008", "page_id": "p0031", "segment_type": "body", "latin_text": "& nos in maximo precio habemus: & ſcrutandas eſ-", "markers": [], "translation_history": [{"version": 1, "stage": "machine_draft", "timestamp": "2026-05-17T03:09:22Z", "english": "and we hold them in the highest esteem; and that the scriptures are to be searched", "notes": "", "uncertain": false, "model": "claude-opus-4-7", "lexicon_profile": "auto", "source_unit_id": "p0031_body_l0008"}], "final_english": "", "translation_status": "machine_draft", "seq": 8}
